{
  "about": "Original Prusa MINI / MINI+ (Printables 307054, Prusa Mini Assembly.STEP, sha256 26d3bad5...). The STEP is written Y-up with the display box at CAD -Z: orient turns it into the display frame (X right, Y up, front toward +Z). Bed = Y (the heatbed on its carriage, bearings and belt holder: CAD Z); gantry = Z (the X axis on the Z rods: CAD Y); head = X and Z (the extruder on the X rods, climbing with the gantry).",
